  "response": {
    "text": "This procedure wipes memory on idle buoy `T-10`. It does not affect active buoy `T-12`.\n\n1. Confirm that permit `WIPE-44` is valid.\n2. Confirm that `T-10` is disconnected.\n3. Confirm that the console shows **Safe to Purge**.\n4. Run `thalassactl buoy check T-10`.\n5. Proceed only if it returns `status=idle mem=full`.\n\nWARNING: The next command permanently deletes all data on `T-10`. A remote restore is impossible.\n\n6. Run `thalassactl buoy purge T-10 --permit WIPE-44`.\n7. Run `thalassactl buoy verify T-10`.\n8. Confirm that it returns `mem=empty`.",
